10:1.3": "Abbhuṭṭhitova so yāti, ", "ja510:1.4": "sagacchaṁ na nivattati. ", "ja510:2.1": "Na yujjhamānā na balenavassitā, ", "ja510:2.2": "Narā na jīranti na cāpi miyyare; ", "ja510:2.3": "Sabbaṁ hidaṁ jātijarāyupaddutaṁ, ", "ja510:2.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:3.1": "Caturaṅginiṁ senaṁ subhiṁsarūpaṁ, ", "ja510:3.2": "Jayanti raṭṭhādhipatī pasayha; ", "ja510:3.3": "Na maccuno jayitumussahanti, ", "ja510:3.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:4.1": "Hatthīhi assehi rathehi pattibhi, ", "ja510:4.2": "Parivāritā muccare ekacceyyā; ", "ja510:4.3": "Na maccuno muccitumussahanti, ", "ja510:4.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:5.1": "Hatthīhi assehi rathehi pattibhi, ", "ja510:5.2": "Sūrā pabhañjanti padhaṁsayanti; ", "ja510:5.3": "Na maccuno bhañjitumussahanti, ", "ja510:5.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:6.1": "Mattā gajā bhinnagaḷā pabhinnā, ", "ja510:6.2": "Nagarāni maddanti janaṁ hananti; ", "ja510:6.3": "Na maccuno madditumussahanti, ", "ja510:6.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:7.1": "Issāsino katahatthāpi vīrā, ", "ja510:7.2": "Dūrepātī akkhaṇavedhinopi; ", "ja510:7.3": "Na maccuno vijjhitumussahanti, ", "ja510:7.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:8.1": "Sarāni khīyanti saselakānanā, ", "ja510:8.2": "Sabbaṁ hidaṁ khīyati dīghamantaraṁ; ", "ja510:8.3": "Sabbaṁ hidaṁ bhañjare kālapariyāyaṁ, ", "ja510:8.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:9.1": "Sabbesa mevaṁ hi narāna nārinaṁ, ", "ja510:9.2": "Calācalaṁ pāṇabhunodha jīvitaṁ; ", "ja510:9.3": "Paṭova dhuttassa dumova kūlajo, ", "ja510:9.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:10.1": "Dumapphalāneva patanti māṇavā, ", "ja510:10.2": "Daharā ca vuddhā ca sarīrabhedā; ", "ja510:10.3": "Nāriyo narā majjhimaporisā ca, ", "ja510:10.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:11.1": "Nāyaṁ vayo tārakarājasannibho, ", "ja510:11.2": "Yadabbhatītaṁ gatameva dāni taṁ; ", "ja510:11.3": "Jiṇṇassa hī natthi ratī kuto sukhaṁ, ", "ja510:11.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:12.1": "Yakkhā pisācā athavāpi petā, ", "ja510:12.2": "Kupitā te assasanti manusse; ", "ja510:12.3": "Na maccuno assasitussahanti, ", "ja510:12.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:13.1": "Yakkhe pisāce athavāpi pete, ", "ja510:13.2": "Kupitepi te nijjhapanaṁ karonti; ", "ja510:13.3": "Na maccuno nijjhapanaṁ karonti, ", "ja510:13.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:14.1": "Aparādhake dūsake heṭhake ca, ", "ja510:14.2": "Rājāno daṇḍenti viditvāna dosaṁ; ", "ja510:14.3": "Na maccuno daṇḍayitussahanti, ", "ja510:14.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:15.1": "Aparādhakā dūsakā heṭhakā ca, ", "ja510:15.2": "Labhanti te rājino nijjhapetuṁ; ", "ja510:15.3": "Na maccuno nijjhapanaṁ karonti, ", "ja510:15.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:16.1": "Na khattiyoti na ca brāhmaṇoti, ", "ja510:16.2": "Na aḍḍhakā balavā tejavāpi; ", "ja510:16.3": "Na maccurājassa apekkhamatthi, ", "ja510:16.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:17.1": "Sīhā ca byagghā ca athopi dīpiyo, ", "ja510:17.2": "Pasayha khādanti vipphandamānaṁ; ", "ja510:17.3": "Na maccuno khāditumussahanti, ", "ja510:17.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:18.1": "Māyākārā raṅgamajjhe karontā, ", "ja510:18.2": "Mohenti cakkhūni janassa tāvade; ", "ja510:18.3": "Na maccuno mohayitussahanti, ", "ja510:18.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:19.1": "Āsīvisā kupitā uggatejā, ", "ja510:19.2": "Ḍaṁsanti mārentipi te manusse; ", "ja510:19.3": "Na maccuno ḍaṁsitumussahanti, ", "ja510:19.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:20.1": "Āsīvisā kupitā yaṁ ḍaṁsanti, ", "ja510:20.2": "Tikicchakā tesa visaṁ hananti; ", "ja510:20.3": "Na maccuno daṭṭhavisaṁ hananti, ", "ja510:20.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:21.1": "Dhammantarī vettaraṇī ca bhojo, ", "ja510:21.2": "Visāni hantvāna bhujaṅgamānaṁ; ", "ja510:21.3": "Suyyanti te kālakatā tatheva, ", "ja510:21.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:22.1": "Vijjādharā ghoramadhīyamānā, ", "ja510:22.2": "Adassanaṁ osadhehi vajanti; ", "ja510:22.3": "Na maccurājassa vajantadassanaṁ, ", "ja510:22.4": "Taṁ me matī hoti carāmi dhammaṁ. ", "ja510:23.1": "Dhammo have rakkhati dhammacāriṁ, ", "ja510:23.2": "Dhammo suciṇṇo sukhamāvahāti; ", "ja510:23.3": "Esānisaṁso dhamme suciṇṇe, ", "ja510:23.4": "Na duggatiṁ gacchati dhammacārī. ", "ja510:24.1": "Na hi dhammo adhammo ca, ", "ja510:24.2": "Ubho samavipākino; ", "ja510:24.3": "Adhammo nirayaṁ neti, ", "ja510:24.4": "Dhammo pāpeti suggatin”ti. ", "ja510:25.1": "Ayogharajātakaṁ cuddasamaṁ. ", "ja510:26.1": "Vīsatinipātaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ. ", "ja510:27.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja510:28.1": "Mātaṅga sambhūta sivi sirimanto, ", "ja510:28.2": "Rohaṇa haṁsa sattigumbo bhallātiya; ", "ja510:28.3": "Somanassa campeyya brahma pañca- ", "ja510:28.4": "Paṇḍita cirassaṁvata ayogharāti. "}, "variant_text": {"ja510:0.1": "", "ja510:0.2": "", "ja510:0.3": "", "ja510:0.4": "", "ja510:1.1": "", "ja510:1.2": "", "ja510:1.3": "yāti → sayati (bj, pts-vp-pli1); sa yāti (katthaci) ", "ja510:1.4": "", "ja510:2.1": "", "ja510:2.2": "", "ja510:2.3": "hidaṁ → hi taṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja510:2.4": "", "ja510:3.1": "", "ja510:3.2": "", "ja510:3.3": "", "ja510:3.4": "", "ja510:4.1": "", "ja510:4.2": "ekacceyyā → ekaceyyā (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja510:4.3": "", "ja510:4.4": "", "ja510:5.1": "", "ja510:5.2": "Sūrā → purā (mr) ", "ja510:5.3": "", "ja510:5.4": "", "ja510:6.1": "", "ja510:6.2": "", "ja510:6.3": "", "ja510:6.4": "", "ja510:7.1": "vīrā → dhīrā (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja510:7.2": "Dūrepātī → … patī (mr) ", "ja510:7.3": "", "ja510:7.4": "", "ja510:8.1": "", "ja510:8.2": "hidaṁ → hi taṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); pi taṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja510:8.3": "hidaṁ → hi taṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja510:8.4": "", "ja510:9.1": "narāna nārinaṁ → nārīnarānaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); narānarīnaṁ (pts-vp-pli1); naranārīnaṁ (mr) ", "ja510:9.2": "", "ja510:9.3": "", "ja5